{"id":9,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield","SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"The rocket cannons on its shell fire jets of water capable of punching holes through thick steel."},{"games":["Sword","X","FireRed"],"text":"It crushes its foe under its heavy body to cause fainting. In a pinch, it will withdraw inside its shell."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"Once it takes aim at its enemy, it blasts out water with even more force than a fire hose."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Blastoise has water spouts that protrude from its shell. The water spouts are very accurate. They can shoot bullets of water with enough accuracy to strike empty cans from a distance of over 160 feet."},{"games":["Y","LeafGreen"],"text":"The pressurized water jets on this brutal Pokémon’s shell are used for high-speed tackles."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"The jets of water it spouts from the rocket cannons on its shell can punch through thick steel."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"It deliberately makes itself heavy so it can withstand the recoil of the water jets it fires."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"The waterspouts that protrude from its shell are highly accurate. Their bullets of water can precisely nail tin cans from a distance of over 160 feet."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"It firmly plants its feet on the ground before shooting water from the jets on its back."},{"games":["Blue","Red"],"text":"A brutal POKéMON with pressurized water jets on its shell. They are used for high speed tackles."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Torrent","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up Water-type moves when the Pokémon's HP is low."},{"name":"Rain Dish","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon gradually regains HP in rain."}],"eggGroups":["Monster","Water 1"],"genderRate":1,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"water's edge","color":"Blue","shape"